# Optional review-only Apache configuration. Do not overwrite existing rules.
# Keep until the owner separately authorizes a production release.
Options -Indexes
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
    Header always set X-Robots-Tag "noindex, nofollow, noarchive"
    Header always set X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
</IfModule>
# Form API hosting is not configured here. See DEPLOYMENT.md.
